Engine/Source/VolFog/VolFogLights.{h,cpp}           from src/engine_lights.* and src/local_light_stabiliser.*
Engine/Source/VolFog/VolFogRender.cpp, VolFogRays.cpp   rewritten over the client's Gx layer following src/renderer.cpp

